      Focal Shape Size: 0.05000000074505806
      Invert Z Axis: false
      Name: Current View
      Near Clip Distance: 0.009999999776482582
      Pitch: 0.3803982436656952
      Target Frame: <Fixed Frame>
      Value: Orbit (rviz)
      Yaw: 0.35039785504341125
    Saved: ~
